  {name:'Founder & team target',percent:15,color:'#aa83e4',text:'31,500,000 SOULI out of the total 210,000,000 supply. A budget target; beneficiary balances, prior distributions and vesting still need reconciliation.'},
  {name:'Other supply',percent:85,color:'#2455ee',text:'Existing holders and commitments, launch sales, liquidity, ecosystem and operations. The detailed split remains under review; this does not describe circulating supply.'},
