  <header class="doc-header"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/images/fungi/token-logo.png" width="38" height="38" alt=""><span>SOULI<small>THE FIELD GUIDE</small></span></a><div><a href="/testnet/">Testnet ↗</a><a class="button mini" href="/soul/">My SOULI ↗</a></div></header>
